(36, 7, 'ইউনাইটেড হাসপাতালে ওয়েক  আপ আইসিটি  কর্তৃক তৈরিকৃত  হার্ট কপ সফটওয়্যার হস্তান্তর……', 'Sharna islam', '2021-11-16', '<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: &quot;Nirmala UI&quot;, &quot;sans-serif&quot;;\">ইউনাইটেড</span><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; line-height: 115%;\"> </span><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: &quot;Nirmala UI&quot;, &quot;sans-serif&quot;;\">হাসপাতালের</span><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; line-height: 115%;\"> </span><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: &quot;Nirmala UI&quot;, &quot;sans-serif&quot;;\">কার্ডিওলোজি</span><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; line-height: 115%;\"> </span><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: &quot;Nirmala UI&quot;, &quot;sans-serif&quot;;\">বিভাগের</span><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; line-height: 115%;\"> </span><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: &quot;Nirmala UI&quot;, &quot;sans-serif&quot;;\">চিকিৎসা\r\nব্যবস্থা</span><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; line-height: 115%;\"> </span><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: &quot;Nirmala UI&quot;, &quot;sans-serif&quot;;\">ও</span><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; line-height: 115%;\"> </span><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: &quot;Nirmala UI&quot;, &quot;sans-serif&quot;;\">আধুনিক</span><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; line-height: 115%;\"> </span><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: &quot;Nirmala UI&quot;, &quot;sans-serif&quot;;\">প্রযুক্তিনির্ভর</span><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; line-height: 115%;\"> </span><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: &quot;Nirmala UI&quot;, &quot;sans-serif&quot;;\">করার</span><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; line-height: 115%;\"> </span><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: &quot;Nirmala UI&quot;, &quot;sans-serif&quot;;\">জন্য </s