</span>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\">তাদের</span>\r\n<span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\">মানসিক</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\">এবং</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\">শারীরিক অবস্থা </span>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\">দুটোই\r\n</span>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\">ক্ষতিগ্রস্ত</span>\r\n<span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\">হয় তাই</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\">&nbsp;কর্মকর্তাদের</span> <span style=\"font-family:\r\n&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\">কাজের</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\">চাপ</span>\r\n<span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\">মুক্ত</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\">করতে</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\">এবং</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\">মানসিক</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\">সুস্থতার</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\">জন্য</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\">খুবই</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\">প্রয়োজন</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\">ছিল</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\">।এবং</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\">তাদের</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\">জন্যই</span> <span style=\"font-